<title>USA: De Rigo Group Q2 sales fall.</title>
<headline>De Rigo Group Q2 sales fall.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>De Rigo Group said Tuesday that net sales for the second quarter were 62.0 billion Italian lira, or US$36.7 million, compared to 74.6 lira the previous second quarter.</p>
<p>Sales for the first six months of the year were 127.4 billion lira, or US$76.5 million, versus 162.3 billion lira the year ago six-month period.</p>
</text>
